WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.542
Shaya isikhonkwane lapho ufuna umugqa wakho uqale khona bese umisa umlenze owodwa eceleni kwaso.

00:00:07.542 --> 00:00:15.792
Hambisa omunye umlenze ukhuphuke noma wehle emthambekeni kuze kube intambo ilenga phezu kophawu lokulinganisa.

00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:18.708
Bethela leyo ndawo ngesikhonkwane.

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:27.750
Gcina lowo mlenze ungahambi, ujikise umlenze wokuqala uwuyise ngale, uphinde uthole ukulinganisa bese ubethela.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:40.000
Qhubeka unqamula umthambeka.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.792
Umugqa ocatshangwayo onqamula umthambeka oxhumanisa amaphuzu asekuphakameni okufanayo.
